.emoji-comment-input-wrapper.emojionearea.input-wrap(
    [ngClass]="[comment.active ? 'active' : '', reply ? 'reply-display' : '']",
    (tap)="!readOnly && activate.emit()"
)
    #emojiCommentInput.emoji-comment-input(
        *ngIf="comment.data.length > 0",
        [innerHtml]="comment.data | emojione"
    )
    .emoji-comment-placeholder(*ngIf="comment.data.length < 1")
        | Emoji comment...
